1️⃣ Host Discovery kya hai?

Suppose tera network hai:
192.168.1.0/24
Is network mein theoretically bahut saare addresses ho sakte hain.

Nmap ko pehle ye pata lagana hota hai:
192.168.1.1   → Alive?
192.168.1.2   → Alive?
192.168.1.3   → Alive?
192.168.1.4   → Alive?

Simple flow
Network
   ↓
Host Discovery
   ↓
Kaun alive hai?
   ↓
Live Hosts
   ↓
Port Scanning


SOC Example:-

Suppose company network mein:
100 devices
hain.

Tum discover karte ho:
192.168.1.10 → Windows PC
192.168.1.15 → Linux Server
192.168.1.20 → Printer
192.168.1.50 → Unknown Device

192.168.1.50 unexpected hai.
Ab SOC investigation start ho sakti hai.


















































